  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Conjuration Sphere, Technique Crafting</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> The companion chosen with this feat or who possesses this feat is treated as having all of the talents and feats you possess, but only for the purpose of performing techniques that you know. When using a technique through this feat, the companion cannot contribute more than one spell point to the effect’s complexity cost.</p>\n<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Card Casting 2: Counters and Control</sup></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/conjuration#toc131\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
